Wed Jun  1 02:03:57 EDT 2011  "Roland Haas" <roland.haas@physics.gatech.edu>
  * visitCarpetHDF5: more speedup patches
  
    * major speedup do to parsing metadata out of the dataset name if possible
      rather than attributes
    * avoid C++ exceptions for cases where they are mostly triggered and replace
      by C style H5E_BEGIN_TRY
    * avoid some eccessive C++ memory allocations wrt std::vector and std::string
